BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:middlesex-actionrequestoncampusrec-357978cace@nascentmaterials.com
DTSTAMP:20260814T171701Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260908
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260909
SUMMARY:[MAJOR] Middlesex - [ACTION] Request on-campus recruiting at Middle
 sex College
LOCATION:Online form (jotform)
DESCRIPTION:SCALE: MAJOR\n\nCHEAPEST CONFIRMED CAMPUS ACCESS OF THE EIGHT S
 CHOOLS. Middlesex runs no ticketed career fair. Instead the Career Readine
 ss and Planning office takes on-campus recruiting requests through a form 
 and replies with a confirmed date or alternatives. No published fee\, no r
 egistration deadline\, no fixed event date. Form: middlesexcc.jotform.com/
 222794813641056. Middlesex also uses Handshake for job and internship post
 ings - add Middlesex College when posting. 85+ degree and certificate prog
 rams.\n\nOUTREACH NOTE: Submit after classes begin so a date can be set in
 side the live semester. Compare: Rutgers Mega Fair had a hard Sep 4 deadli
 ne\, NJIT is $475-$925\, TCNJ $400. This one is a form.\n\nSOURCE: https:/
 /middlesexcollege.edu/academics/career-planning/career-planning-for-employ
 ers/\n\n(Compiled 2026-08-10. Verify before acting.)
CATEGORIES:Middlesex\,MAJOR
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:middlesex-actionmiddlesexvendoropp-7df30f0a4b@nascentmaterials.com
DTSTAMP:20260814T171701Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260908
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260909
SUMMARY:[minor] Middlesex - [ACTION] Middlesex 'Vendor Opportunities' is pr
 ocurement\, NOT tabling
LOCATION:Reference entry
DESCRIPTION:SCALE: minor\n\nRecorded so nobody chases it twice. middlesexco
 llege.edu/vendor-opportunities/ is the purchasing/bidding portal for selli
 ng goods and services TO the college - sealed bids\, Chambers Hall Room 12
 9\, purchasing@middlesexcollege.edu. It has nothing to do with student-fac
 ing tabling or campus presence. The real routes are on-campus recruiting (
 above) and facility rentals.\n\nOUTREACH NOTE: Dead end for outreach. Use 
 the recruiting form instead.\n\nSOURCE: https://middlesexcollege.edu/vendo
 r-opportunities/\n\n(Compiled 2026-08-10. Verify before acting.)
CATEGORIES:Middlesex\,minor
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
